        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Localise a Product Listing\n\nRewrites a US product listing for the UK market. It converts units, currency and spelling, which is where listings usually break in a new market.\n\n**How it works:** Paste the listing into \"Input\". \"Agent\" follows its system prompt to convert units to metric, prices to GBP with a placeholder rate, and US spelling to UK spelling, and it flags anything that needs a human decision. \"Output\" shows the UK listing.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"Agent\", then edit its system prompt to target another market, such as Germany with euros."
        },
